                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-black/10 transition-colors duration-500"></div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6">
                        <span class="bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-label-sm font-label-sm text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest">Trong Nhà</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mb-2">Grand Salon</h3>
                <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Không gian ấm cúng, sang trọng với hệ thống điều hòa và nhạc nhẹ, lý tưởng cho những bữa tối thân mật.</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Area 2: Outdoor Terrace -->
            <div class="group cursor-pointer">
                <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl h-[400px] mb-stack-md">
                    <div class="w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAtMCws0gHUtAtuYVmAmgyxp8h8aeQOby4yz7Z15SWQvlaJiQnEUrAONOKDqr2hiVfhaMAXDA_sKVDKWcddRzys-UfAg5RodOaOm4n7JVHIZO36xYzCitk3Ui2Y8GRn-w7mvwbYmJDZbgF0As18knzq0W3L5YJ3utJbhHf-r9XEWqKrA3sK9SFSd5ayUPLHEw583H4wdR92jM3ky-SlD7Yla2GrLhLZk-plHazZhvxIvbVO9jR9sklzZolVCVq_nrxPDAUSelMtpApx')">
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-black/10 transition-colors duration-500"></div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6">
                        <span class="bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-label-sm font-label-sm text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest">Ngoài Trời</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mb-2">The Terrace</h3>
                <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Tận hưởng gió biển rì rào và bầu trời đầy sao tại hiên nhà hàng, mang lại cảm giác khoáng đạt, tự do.</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Area 3: Poolside -->
            <div class="group cursor-pointer">
                <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl h-[400px] mb-stack-md">
                    <div class="w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBjDcq0DfvyNM7eID7c1n7YcWvZ258-KjGDrukbNIv1_F6yujZMmxRzksd70WEfDFJH0h-W7xxL0lTCqQrZNpnXynXsFK-1eZjhDpWIfOuBx259bzchF_px-J8g41Xfuh5jrVHlyn-rTPkUtBlcblQWvlj7X9YyLpK9-SPisYaPO98RqpOnELTUQaCUle0d8ZdUcJWkbFfuyZP6NhZm8DmMUVNkgXJxqBcu2QnFSZxaSYnX3z1nCjdqME1LwLQYgNl1frr5Ef6lk54k')">
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-black/10 transition-colors duration-500"></div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6">
                        <span class="bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-label-sm font-label-sm text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest">Cạnh Hồ Bơi</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mb-2">Azure Lounge</h3>
                <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Sự kết hợp hoàn hảo giữa làn nước mát lành và ánh sáng nghệ thuật, tạo nên không gian lãng mạn bậc nhất.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Promotional Bento Section -->
    <section class="bg-surface-container py-section-gap-lg">
        <div class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter h-auto md:h-[600px]">
                <div class="md:col-span-7 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/10 overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center p-stack-lg relative">
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-primary mb-stack-md leading-tight">Tiệc Tối <br /> Riêng Tư</h2>
                        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-stack-lg max-w-md">Chúng tôi cung cấp dịch vụ đặt tiệc riêng cho các dịp đặc biệt: sinh nhật, kỷ niệm hoặc tiếp đãi đối tác quan trọng.</p>
                        <button class="border border-secondary text-secondary px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-label-lg text-label-lg hover:bg-secondary hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">Tìm Hiểu Thêm</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] right-[-5%] w-1/2 opacity-20 pointer-events-none">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[300px] text-primary-container">restaurant_menu</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-5 grid grid-rows-2 gap-gutter">
